```

## Disposition

The provenance question is settled: HOBS's `0.058 rad` is a one-sided
half-power off-axis angle. The design question is intentionally not settled:
the owner has declared half-power angle to be a system design parameter, and
this report neither recommends nor ranks a choice. The curve shows where the
bounded set coordinator has value and what service/interference consequences
accompany that value.
